<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Grafana-Alloy - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/tags/grafana-alloy/</link><description>Grafana-Alloy - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kentxxq.com/tags/grafana-alloy/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>grafana-alloy教程</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/grafana-alloy%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/grafana-alloy%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="简介" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p><code>grafana-alloy</code> 是 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/grafana/">grafana</a> 的客户端组件, 替代 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/grafana-agent%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/">grafana-agent</a> .</p>
<p>使用它的原因主要是兼容 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/OpenTelemetry-Collector%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/">OpenTelemetry-Collector</a>, 如果使用 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/grafana/">grafana</a> 全家桶, 可以减少配置项.</p>
<h2 id="安装" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85" class="header-mark"></a>安装</h2><ul>
<li>安装:
<ul>
<li>参考 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/grafana-ui%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/#%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85">grafana-ui的服务安装</a> ,使用 <code>apt install alloy -y</code> 安装即可.</li>
<li>使用 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/Systemd/">systemd</a> 进行服务管理.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="配置文件" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6" class="header-mark"></a>配置文件</h2><ul>
<li>参考 <a href="https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/tasks/collect-opentelemetry-data/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">alloy官方采集opentelmetry数据文档</a>
<ul>
<li><code>otlp</code> 是 <code>grpc</code> , <code>otlphttp</code> 是 <code>http1.1</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">支持的组件列表</a></li>
</ul>
